Built-in library (images/ and data/):

Faces (images/face/, data "face")
  From AI Model Face Database by あぎ (@agi_aibusi), https://ai-portrait-gallery.pages.dev/
  Released by its author under CC0 1.0. Included here as web-size copies
  (300 and 900 px wide WebP). Hair and style labels come from the same site.
  The author asks that the images themselves not be redistributed; the full-size
  originals are only on the author's site.

Poses (images/pose/, data "pose")
  1,439 views from ポーズ集 POSE-DB-01 by ギア (@giaaibusi),
  https://ai-pose-gallery.pages.dev/, included as w300 thumbnails and
  full-resolution w900 WebP copies (900×1200).
  Upstream terms: images are free for creative work but may not be redistributed,
  reposted or resold, and may not depict real people or minors. See GIA.md.

Depth maps (images/pose-depth-official/, data "depth-official")
  1,439 depth views from Depthポーズ集 POSE-DB-02 by ギア, included as w300
  thumbnails and full-resolution w900 WebP copies (900×1200) under the same
  upstream terms as the poses above. See GIA.md.

Outfits (images/outfit/, data "outfit")
  400 outfits made for this project with an AI image model from our own text
