CharaDB anime outfits (images/outfit/ANM-*, ANX-*, data "outfit")
  440 outfits by たき AI (@taki_auto), https://charadb-2fi.pages.dev/, included as
  w300 thumbnails and full-resolution w900 WebP copies (1024×1536). Upstream
  terms: images are reference-only, may not be
  redistributed, reposted or resold, and may not be used to depict real people or
  minors. Tags/names are CC0 1.0 and the official code is MIT, but the images are
  neither. See CHARADB.md.

Local packs (generated on your machine; not part of this repository):

Generated depth poses (optional)
  tools/make_depth_poses.py generates depth maps from Shisei's CC0 line art with
  Depth Anything V2 Small (Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/DepthAnything/Depth-Anything-V2). The input line art is CC0
  and the generated depth maps are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
  They are an optional local pack in images/pose-depth/ and data/depth.js, are
  git-ignored, and are loaded only when Settings → Depth poses → Generated (CC0)
  is selected. They are not part of the repository or the GitHub Pages site.

All people shown are AI-generated adults or faceless mannequins and do not depict
